//// blog — rakun-ssr's acceptance app (front 53), module-tree root.
////
//// The routing tree lives under `src/app/` (`rakun-ssr.json`'s `appDir`). Its
//// `[slug]` and `(marketing)` directories are not module identifiers, so
//// only `rakun-ssr build`'s staged tree reaches them (front 50); this root and
//// `app/mod.bp` declare what a plain `mod` path reaches, which is what the
//// in-process tests import.

pub mod lib;
pub mod components;
pub mod app;
